# Asking before a sheprd:// link from another application opens a
# workspace in a folder.

open-checkout-title = 是否在此文件夹中打开工作区？
open-checkout-note = 另一个应用中的链接发起了此请求。新工作区将在那里启动 shell；不会运行仓库脚本。
open-checkout-open = 打开
open-checkout-cancel = 取消
# Names the request in an error, as "Open workspace: <error>".
open-checkout-operation = 打开工作区
open-checkout-busy = 打开链接：请先关闭已打开的对话框
open-checkout-unavailable = 打开链接：本机上的 Herdr 不可用
open-checkout-disconnected = 打开链接：未连接到本机上的 Herdr
